This isolated historical adapter includes community GRAM code from
https://github.com/ad3002/gram and project trajectory-Mixer/query-only extensions.
The original MIT notice, Copyright (c) 2026 Aleksey Komissarov, is retained
verbatim in LICENSE. This is not the official ahn-ml/gram-release implementation,
and not the project's task-specific GRU solver.

The dataset dispatch is restricted to Maze and N-Queens; the model, decoder and
Mixer algorithms are copied unchanged from the recorded project snapshot.
Weights, data and experiment records require separate publication approval and
are not automatically licensed by this code license. SATLIB raw data is absent.
